arrow{\\sim}\\mathbf{Eff}(\\nabla X,\\nabla Y).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\Gamma\\dashv\\nabla,\\qquad\n\\mathbf{Set}(X,Y)\\xrightarrow{\\sim}\\mathbf{Eff}(\\nabla X,\\nabla Y).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>自然双射及构造证明见规范原子。以实际Hom映射双射表达满忠实，消除无来源的Full/Faithful谓词；自然数实现码不作为额外态射数据。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"16-thm-sets-embedding-eff","status":"resolved","id":"c18e2a4a9af5e4cb","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[16-thm-sets-embedding-eff]]","embed":false},{"target":"16-thm-sets-embedding-eff","status":"resolved","id":"c18e2a4a9af5e4cb","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\nabla:\\mathbf{Set}\\to\\mathbf{Eff}$ 与 $\\Gamma:\\mathbf{Eff}\\to\\mathbf{Set}$ 取 [[16-thm-sets-embedding-eff]] 同一显式构造；$X,Y$ 为任意小集合。","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"\\nabla:\\mathbf{Set}\\to\\mathbf{Eff}","display":false},{"tex":"\\Gamma:\\mathbf{Eff}\\to\\mathbf{Set}","display":false},{"tex":"X,Y","display":false},{"tex":"\\Gamma\\dashv\\nabla,\\qquad\n\\mathbf{Set}(X,Y)\\xrightarrow{\\sim}\\mathbf{Eff}(\\nabla X,\\nabla Y).","display":true}],"bytes":868,"backlinks":[{"id":"1bdcb9b14f83cac1","anchor":"ref-452","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[16-thm-sets-embedding|thm-sets-embedding — Compatibility statement]]"}],"outgoing":["c18e2a4a9af5e4cb"]}